  <name>GreenLight</name>
  <summary>Browse, verify, and install NVIDIA Linux drivers</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      A GTK4/libadwaita application for browsing available NVIDIA driver
      versions, downloading official .run installers with SHA256
      verification, and performing a polkit-authorized, DKMS-aware
      installation. Includes system status checks for GPU, kernel,
      secure boot, and disk space.
    </p>
  </description>
